# NOTE: .cache/ is deliberately COMMITTED. http.sqlite holds primary-source API
# responses and search_results.json holds recorded search result sets; together
# they let this repository be reproduced with no search credentials and no
# spend. Article bodies are pruned out before committing — they are most of the
# size, and scraped pages carry third-party secrets.
# Run `uv run python scripts/warm_cache.py --prune` before committing a cache
# that has grown. 
